{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless fantasy action and adventure await you and your friends in Dungeons of Eternity. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hack-n-slash takes on a new meaning in VR: swing swords, throw axes, use bows, wield magic staffs, and more to make it out alive. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >COOP OR SOLO PLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Band together for an unforgettable cooperative experience with up to 4 players, or delve into the dungeons yourself. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189340/extras/77189e93bb499288d106e9065ea0f8a7.poster.avif?t=1769632774\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189340/extras/77189e93bb499288d106e9065ea0f8a7.webm?t=1769632774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189340/extras/77189e93bb499288d106e9065ea0f8a7.mp4?t=1769632774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EVER-CHANGING DUNGEONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore randomly-generated dungeons across multiple game modes and realms - no dungeon run is the same. A vast array of chambers await, from combat arenas, puzzle and trap rooms, secret chambers, and more. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189340/extras/8ac3ec5bc4ea74f0ce3134999cf81b07.poster.avif?t=1769632774\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189340/extras/8ac3ec5bc4ea74f0ce3134999cf81b07.webm?t=1769632774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189340/extras/8ac3ec5bc4ea74f0ce3134999cf81b07.mp4?t=1769632774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEEL THE DUNGEONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hack-n-slash like never before with a visceral physics-based combat system and realistic interactions with the game world. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189340/extras/1f4e810d35974bf144f2d49201be5f4f.poster.avif?t=1769632774\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189340/extras/1f4e810d35974bf144f2d49201be5f4f.webm?t=1769632774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189340/extras/1f4e810d35974bf144f2d49201be5f4f.mp4?t=1769632774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENDLESS ARSENAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every weapon is randomly generated, offering nearly endless loot within the dungeons. You will discover many weapon types, including swords, bows, magic staffs, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189340/extras/93103b50e18bfe03ef229e22a9ef76bc.poster.avif?t=1769632774\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189340/extras/93103b50e18bfe03ef229e22a9ef76bc.webm?t=1769632774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189340/extras/93103b50e18bfe03ef229e22a9ef76bc.mp4?t=1769632774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY YOUR WAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft your playstyle and appearance through loadouts, upgrades, and a diverse set of character customization options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189340/extras/ac919b510d6f04861bbb5b5edbd9a849.poster.avif?t=1769632774\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189340/extras/ac919b510d6f04861bbb5b5edbd9a849.webm?t=1769632774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189340/extras/ac919b510d6f04861bbb5b5edbd9a849.mp4?t=1769632774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Dungeon Raider","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3189340/7f96e4c4000ada1fbb73019b83638293227246e7.jpg"},{"name":"Fellow Explorers","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3189340/7f96e4c4000ada1fbb73019b83638293227246e7.jpg"},{"name":"Cheated Death","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3189340/7f96e4c4000ada1fbb73019b83638293227246e7.jpg"},{"name":"Champion of the Arena","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3189340/7f96e4c4000ada1fbb73019b83638293227246e7.jpg"},{"name":"First Responder","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3189340/7f96e4c4000ada1fbb73019b83638293227246e7.jpg"},{"name":"Shield Basher","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3189340/7f96e4c4000ada1fbb73019b83638293227246e7.jpg"},{"name":"Bug Stomper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3189340/7f96e4c4000ada1fbb73019b83638293227246e7.jpg"},{"name":"PvP Predator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3189340/7f96e4c4000ada1fbb73019b836382