uted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189340/extras/1f4e810d35974bf144f2d49201be5f4f.poster.avif?t=1769632774\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189340/extras/1f4e810d35974bf144f2d49201be5f4f.webm?t=1769632774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189340/extras/1f4e810d35974bf144f2d49201be5f4f.mp4?t=1769632774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ENDLESS ARSENAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every weapon is randomly generated, offering nearly endless loot within the dungeons. You will discover many weapon types, including swords, bows, magic staffs, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189340/extras/93103b50e18bfe03ef229e22a9ef76bc.poster.avif?t=1769632774\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189340/extras/93103b50e18bfe03ef229e22a9ef76bc.webm?t=1769632774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189340/extras/93103b50e18bfe03ef229e22a9ef76bc.mp4?t=1769632774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLAY YOUR WAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft your playstyle and appearance through loadouts, upgrades, and a diverse set of character customization options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3189340/extras/ac919b510d6f04861bbb5b5edbd9a849.poster.avif?t=1769632774\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.ste